# 统一换行符：远端是 Linux，**shell 脚本带 CRLF 会直接报 `\r: command not found`**。
# 这条规则让 `git checkout` 出来的 .sh 永远是 LF，省掉每次上传后的 `sed -i "s/\r$//"`。
*.sh   text eol=lf
*.py   text eol=lf
*.yaml text eol=lf
*.yml  text eol=lf
*.md   text eol=lf
*.txt  text eol=lf
*.json text eol=lf
*.svm  text eol=lf

# 二进制：不做任何行尾转换
*.pcd    binary
*.onnx   binary
*.zip    binary
*.mp4    binary
*.bag    binary
*.bin    binary
*.dae    binary
*.stl    binary
*.png    binary
*.jpg    binary
